# This file contains a list of files that will be excluded from Shopify CLI
# operations such as push, pull, dev, etc.
#
# Examples:
#
# Ignore a specific file:
#   templates/product.json
#
# Ignore templates with a wildcard pattern:
#   templates/*.json
#
# Ignore templates and sections with a regular expression:
#   /(templates|sections)/.*\.json/

# --- Non-theme / local files ---
# CLI 4.8.4+ uploads root AGENTS.md and DESIGN.md with the theme. Ours are internal
# project docs, not theme content (and AGENTS.md exceeds the 50 KB upload limit).
AGENTS.md
DESIGN.md
*.txt
.git/*
node_modules/*
# docs/ holds plans, reviews and QA records; never upload any of it.
docs/*

# Merchant-controlled config (config/settings_data.json, templates/*.json,
# sections/*-group.json) is deliberately NOT ignored: on this dev store, features
# ship by pushing those files (e.g. footer-group.json social URLs). Ignore them
# before this theme deploys to a real merchant's store.
